# Brain Folder

This folder contains long-term knowledge about the project.

## memory.md
Important project context that the AI should remember across tasks.

## decisions.md
Important technical or architectural decisions and WHY they were made.

## domain.md
Important business/domain concepts and their meanings.

## business-rules.md
Rules that the application must always follow.

## current-behavior.md
What the existing application actually does today.
This must be based on code and tests, not assumptions.

## dependencies.md
Important external systems, libraries, services and integrations.

## Rules

- Do not invent information.
- Update only the relevant file.
- Do not duplicate information unnecessarily.
- If code contradicts these files, report the contradiction.
